You're just going to hear their song.
你们只会听到他们的歌曲。

302
00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:38.440
But then there are master rights, and that's what you need if a character is going to sing
但接下来是录音版权，如果某个角色要唱歌

303
00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:39.720
