和鲍勃，凯利和安迪，还有凯文和琳，他们正在疯狂地亲热。

1689
01:13:43.280 --> 01:13:47.820
Michael notices Angela is tapping her foot to the music and he smiles to himself.
迈克尔注意到安吉拉正随着音乐敲打着脚，他暗自微笑。

1690
01:13:48.080 --> 01:13:50.520
And this is the voiceover that would then play.
接着本该播放这段画外音。

1691
01:14:10.660 --> 01:14:12.960
That actually made me get a little choked up.
这实际上让我有点哽咽了。

1692
01:14:13.340 --> 01:14:14.020
I know.
我知道。

1693
01:14:14.080 --> 01:14:15.120
Isn't that so sweet?
是不是很甜？

1694
01:14:15.340 --> 01:14:16.680
I really wish that had been in.
我真的很希望这段能剪进去。

1695
01:14:16.840 --> 01:14:17.480
I know.
我知道。

1696
01:14:17.660 --> 01:14:18.900
I thought that was really sweet.
我觉得这真的很甜。

1697
01:14:18.900 --> 01:14:25.080
One other thing I want to share is that when we were filming in Cafe Disco and trying to
我还想分享的一件事是，当我们在迪斯科咖啡厅拍摄，并试图

1698
01:14:25.080 --> 01:14:32.160
figure out this moment of how Michael would see my foot swaying, my finger tapping, we shot
弄清楚迈克尔如何看到我的脚在摇晃、手指在敲击这个镜头时，我们拍了一个

1699
01:14:32.160 --> 01:14:34.720
just a quick little tag that didn't make it in.
很快的小尾声，但最后没用上。

1700
01:14:35.240 --> 01:14:40.100
And everyone has left Cafe Disco and only Angela Martin is in there cleaning.
那就是所有人离开迪斯科咖啡厅后，只有安吉拉·马丁还在里面打扫卫生。

1701
01:14:41.380 --> 01:14:45.480
And Michael walks by and she is dancing as she cleans.
然后迈克尔走过去，她一边打扫一边跳舞。

1702
01:14:46.040 --> 01:14:47.900
Why do I remember this?
为什么我记得这个？

1703
01:14:47.900 --> 01:14:52.440
We just shot it really quickly and just as an alt, just in case.
我们当时拍得很快，作为一个备选方案，以防万一。

1704
01:14:52.740 --> 01:14:53.020
Yeah.
对。

1705
01:14:53.280 --> 01:14:57.380
Like you actually respond to the music when everybody's left.
就像所有人都离开后，你真的会对音乐做出反应。

1706
01:14:57.660 --> 01:14:58.200
Everyone's left.
所有人都离开了。

1707
01:14:58.200 --> 01:14:59.020
But it's still that victory.
但那种胜利感依然存在。

1708
01:14:59.020 --> 01:15:00.060
He still got you.
他还是抓到你了。

1709
01:15:00.180 --> 01:15:00.400
Yeah.
是的。

1710
01:15:00.520 --> 01:15:01.880
But that didn't make it in.
但那段没有剪进去。

1711
01:15:01.980 --> 01:15:02.920
It's not in the shooting draft.
它不在拍摄剧本里。

1712
01:15:03.060 --> 01:15:04.120
It's not in deleted scenes.
它也不在删减片段里。

1713
01:15:04.360 --> 01:15:06.800
But that was an alt that they shot.
但那是他们拍摄的一个备选镜头。

1714
01:15:07.060 --> 01:15:10.480
I wonder if we were all like waiting in the hallway while you did that or something because
我在想，当时我们是不是都在走廊里等你做完那些，因为

1715
01:15:10.480 --> 01:15:11.880
I have such a memory of it.
我对它有这么深的印象。

1716
01:15:12.040 --> 01:15:12.820
It was really quick.
真的很短平快。

1717
01:15:12.820 --> 01:15:14.480
We just sort of grabbed it in the moment.
我们当时就是顺手捕捉了这个瞬间。

1718
01:15:14.780 --> 01:15:20.300
But of course, the actual tag that made it in, which is so great, is Kelly piercing Andy's
但当然，真正剪进正片里的那个结尾——太棒了——是凯莉在洗手间给安迪

1719
01:15:20.300 --> 01:15:22.160
ear in the restroom.
穿耳洞。

1720
01:15:22.740 --> 01:15:26.280
This really lends itself to that idea that they could be a couple.
这真的很符合他们可能会成为一对的想法。

1721
01:15:26.480 --> 01:15:27.160
I know.
我知道。

1722
01:15:27.220 --> 01:15:29.160
Because this is a very cute couple-y thing.
因为这是一件非常可爱、像情侣会做的事。

1723
01:15:29.300 --> 01:15:29.900
It is.
确实是。

1724
01:15:30.000 --> 01:15:36.580
And Halstead said that they actually did a take where Mindy, as Kelly, fully pierces Andy's
霍尔斯特德说，他们实际上拍过一个版本：敏迪饰演的凯莉，真的把安迪的

1725
01:15:36.580 --> 01:15:41.620
ear, and it was painful and bloody and a mess, but they cut it for time.
耳洞给穿了，又痛又流血，一团糟，但为了控制时长被剪掉了。

1726
01:15:43.800 --> 01:15:45.060
Well, that's it, guys.
好了，就是这样，各位。

1727
01:15:45.080 --> 01:15:46.380
That's Cafe Disco.
这就是“咖啡迪斯科”。

1728
01:15:46.640 --> 01:15:47.340
It is.
没错。

1729
01:15:47.400 --> 01:15:48.720
And it was so fun.
而且真的很有趣。

1730
01:15:48.720 --> 01:15:50.120
I loved re-watching this.
我特别喜欢重看这集。

1731
01:15:50.260 --> 01:15:54.520
Thank you so much to Warren Lieberstein and Halstead Sullivan, Randy Cordray, for giving
非常感谢沃伦·利伯斯坦、霍尔斯特德·沙利文、兰迪·科德雷，

1732
01:15:54.520 --> 01:15:56.780
us all kinds of fun behind-the-scenes details.
为我们提供了各种有趣的幕后细节。

1733
01:15:57.100 --> 01:16:00.760
And lady, before we go, you know how at the beginning of the episodes, we always say, like,
还有，亲爱的，在我们结束之前，你知道在每集开头，我们总是会说，比如，

1734
01:16:00.840 --> 01:16:01.680
when do you listen?
你们什么时候听？

1735
01:16:01.800 --> 01:16:02.620
Where do you listen?
你们在哪里听？

1736
01:16:02.780 --> 01:16:04.020
You always say good morning.
你总是说早安。

1737
01:16:04.020 --> 01:16:06.720
And then you remember that people might not listen in the morning.
然后你又想起来，大家可能不一定在早上听。

1738
01:16:06.940 --> 01:16:07.240
Yes.
没错。

1739
01:16:07.620 --> 01:16:13.000
Well, we got a letter from Katie C., who is 14 years old, lives in the UK.
嗯，我们收到了一封来自凯蒂·C的信，她14岁，住在英国。

1740
01:16:13.220 --> 01:16:19.700
And she said, I listen to Office Ladies whilst delivering newspapers every day, and it makes
她说，我每天在送报纸的时候听《办公室女士》，这让

1741
01:16:19.700 --> 01:16:25.020
it so much more fun when it's raining or way too warm for my ginger jeans.
下雨天或者天气热得不适合穿红色牛仔裤时变得有趣多了。

1742
01:16:25.240 --> 01:16:29.220
I know I have the podcast to keep me going, and I never give up.
我知道我有这个播客陪着我，我永远不会放弃。

1743
01:16:29.600 --> 01:16:31.100
I love that.
我太喜欢这个了。

1744
01:16:31.400 --> 01:16:32.180
Well, hi, Katie.
那么，嗨，凯蒂。

1745
01:16:32.440 --> 01:16:33.240
Hi, Katie.
嗨，凯蒂。

1746
01:16:33.240 --> 01:16:35.320
Good luck today on your paper route.
祝你今天的送报路线一切顺利。

1747
01:16:35.480 --> 01:16:36.080
Be safe.
注意安全。

1748
